{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$comment": "Post-certification delta L0506-D003 (AI-006 / TOOL-005 / TOOL-017 / MINION-002: the tool-result runtime value domain; Owner decision WP132-RUST-C002-Q001 Option 1). Scenarios live in conformance/agent/tool-result-domain/*.json, discriminated by a top-level `tool_result_domain` key. For each case a runner drives the REAL composed stack (L0506-D003-R002): it registers ONE tool (no prepare_arguments, schema {type: object, properties: {}}) whose execute returns `tool.returns` (or throws `tool.throws`), registers the after-hook `hook` describes, and lets a scripted provider make ONE call with arguments {} followed by a final reply; the agent loop itself finalizes the result, builds the ToolResultMessage, appends it to the session log and dispatches its events. The runner then OBSERVES -- by value, never by identity -- what the after-hook receives (`expect.hook`; null when mode is none), the live tool_execution_end payload (`expect.execution_end`), the live tool-result message (`expect.message`), the message as committed-history replay derives it from the log (`expect.session`: the certified Layer-03 log keeps the live value, MINION-002), and, where the binding rebuilds events from the log (Python: Layer-08 `project`), the replayed tool_execution_end, which must equal `expect.execution_end` (L0506-D003-R001); a binding without such a surface skips that observation. The runner performs no decoding, normalization or conversion on the pipeline's behalf. A gate-WP-13.2 document instead runs the REAL edit tool (`edit_case`). VALUE GRAMMAR: L0206-D002's -- {\"utf16\": units} a string (any UTF-16 code units, unpaired surrogates included); {\"number\": token} a number (see $defs.token, which adds NaN); {\"$keys\": [[units, value], ...]} an object whose keys need code units; any other object an object with those ASCII keys; arrays; true/false/null. OBJECTS COMPARE AS KEY SETS: enumeration order is L0206-D001's (K1). Pinned Pi's session FILE projection is recorded per case as `pi_session_file` (evidence only).",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "name",
    "family",
    "authority",
    "pi_revision",
    "requirements",
    "witnesses",
    "tool_result_domain"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "family": {
      "const": "agent"
    },
    "authority": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "pi_revision": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "requirements": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[A-Z]+-[0-9]{3}$"
      }
    },
    "witnesses": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1
      }
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "gate": {
      "const": "WP-13.2"
    },
    "tool_result_domain": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "cases"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "cases": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/case"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/edit_case"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "if": {
    "required": [
      "gate"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "properties": {
      "tool_result_domain": {
        "properties": {
          "cases": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/edit_case"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "else": {
    "properties": {
      "tool_result_domain": {
        "properties": {
          "cases": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/case"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "units": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 65535
      }
    },
    "token": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "enum": [
            "+Infinity",
            "-Infinity",
            "-0",
            "NaN"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^-?(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?([eE][+-]?[0-9]+)?$"
        }
      ],
      "$comment": "The L0206-D002-R002 token grammar plus NaN: a tool result is not produced by JSON.parse, and pinned Pi carries NaN in details unchanged through every in-memory boundary (L0506-D003). A NAMED token (+Infinity, -Infinity, -0, NaN) or a FINITE LITERAL that is exactly its binary64 value's ECMAScript Number::toString (PREFLIGHT, language-neutral, before dispatch; a violation fails the document). An integral finite literal is the binding's integer representation of that exact value. Observation is strict and total; the expected observation is computed from the scenario text, never through the fixture decoder."
    },
    "value": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "utf16"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "utf16": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/units"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "number"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "number": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/token"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "$keys"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "$keys": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "array",
                "prefixItems": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/units"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/$defs/value"
                  }
                ],
                "minItems": 2,
                "maxItems": 2
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "not": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "required": [
                  "utf16"
                ]
              },
              {
                "required": [
                  "number"
                ]
              },
              {
                "required": [
                  "$keys"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "propertyNames": {
            "pattern": "^[ -~]*$"
          },
          "additionalProperties": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/value"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/value"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "case": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "tool",
        "hook",
        "expect",
        "pi_session_file"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "tool": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "returns"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "returns": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/stored"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "throws"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "throws": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/value",
                  "$comment": "a {\"utf16\": units} string"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "hook": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/hook"
        },
        "expect": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "hook",
            "execution_end",
            "message",
            "session"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "hook": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/observed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "execution_end": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/observed"
            },
            "message": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/observed"
            },
            "session": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/stored"
            }
          }
        },
        "pi_session_file": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "line_utf8_hex",
            "reload"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "line_utf8_hex": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})+$"
            },
            "reload": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/stored"
            }
          },
          "$comment": "EVIDENCE ONLY, asserted by no current runner: pinned Pi's session FILE projection of this result (session-manager.ts `${JSON.stringify(entry)}\\n`, then JSON.parse on reload). Minion has no session file today; a future persisted form MUST reproduce this projection there and only there."
        }
      }
    },
    "observed": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "content",
        "details",
        "is_error"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "content": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "utf16"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "utf16": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/units"
              }
            }
          },
          "$comment": "the result's text content blocks, in order"
        },
        "details": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/value"
        },
        "is_error": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    },
    "stored": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "content",
        "details"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "content": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "utf16"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "utf16": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/units"
              }
            }
          },
          "$comment": "the result's text content blocks, in order"
        },
        "details": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/value"
        }
      }
    },
    "hook": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "mode"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "mode": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "observe",
            "same",
            "null",
            "replace",
            "throws"
          ]
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "utf16"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "utf16": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/units"
              }
            }
          },
          "$comment": "the result's text content blocks, in order"
        },
        "details": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/value"
        },
        "message": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/value",
          "$comment": "a {\"utf16\": units} string"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "none: no after-hook. observe: returns nothing. same: returns {content, details} = what it received. null: returns {details: null} (pinned Pi `afterResult.details ?? result.details` keeps the tool's details). replace: returns the given content and/or details. throws: throws an error whose message is `message`."
    },
    "edit_case": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "edit",
        "hook",
        "expect",
        "pi_session_file"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "edit": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "file_utf8_hex",
            "arguments"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "file_utf8_hex": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})*$"
            },
            "arguments": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "path",
                "edits"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "path": {
                  "const": "f.txt"
                },
                "edits": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/value",
                  "$comment": "a {\"utf16\": units} string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "hook": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/hook"
        },
        "expect": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "hook",
            "execution_end",
            "message",
            "session",
            "file_utf8_hex"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "hook": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/observed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "execution_end": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/observed"
            },
            "message": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/observed"
            },
            "session": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/stored"
            },
            "file_utf8_hex": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})*$"
            }
          }
        },
        "pi_session_file": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "line_utf8_hex",
            "reload"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "line_utf8_hex": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})+$"
            },
            "reload": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/stored"
            }
          },
          "$comment": "EVIDENCE ONLY, asserted by no current runner: pinned Pi's session FILE projection of this result (session-manager.ts `${JSON.stringify(entry)}\\n`, then JSON.parse on reload). Minion has no session file today; a future persisted form MUST reproduce this projection there and only there."
        }
      },
      "$comment": "gate WP-13.2 only: the REAL edit tool on a fixture f.txt holding file_utf8_hex."
    }
  }
}
